    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37579" root="لجب" body-key="l">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِلْجَابٌ</span></b>  <i>An arrow feathered, but without the
point:</i> (K:) pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَلَاجِيبُ</span>. (TA.) <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِنْجَابٌ</span> is the
more common word; and the <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ل</span> appears to be
substituted for the <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ن</span>. (ISd.)

